{"id":"vez","lemma":"vez","pos":"noun","rank":62,"glosses":["time, instance","place (in a queue)","turn (a chance to use (something) shared in sequence with others)"],"ipa":"/ˈbeθ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"veces"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-vez.wav","formAudio":{"veces":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cb/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-veces.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Entra de una vez.","en":"Do come in.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/424928"},{"text":"Lo comprobé dos veces.","en":"I checked it twice.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/821254"},{"text":"¿Quién da la vez?","en":"Who's next?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301065"},{"text":"Él vino varias veces.","en":"He came several times.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/34689"},{"text":"Venga, prueba otra vez.","en":"OK, try again.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/850172"}]}